  aaa authentication enable default local
  aaa authentication login default local
                                       <-- no "aaa accounting" line of any kind remains

  Then a 40 s capture, with a full SSH session (login, "show clock", "enable",
  "configure terminal", "end", logout) AND console commands driven through it:

  0 packets captured
  FILEWIN /var/log/tac_plus.acct ... new-bytes=0 new-lines=0 matched=0

  => STEP 12 PASS: every accounting mode this case configured removes completely.
     There are 0 records and 0 packets under the same stimulus that produced 44
     records and many flows.  The only TACACS+ line left at this point is this case's
     own setup line, "tacacs-server host 10.38.22.33", and it was removed afterwards.

